{"seq":3,"slug":"viz-tools","title":"可视化工具","docCount":6,"url":"/h/data-science/data-visualization/viz-tools","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"d3-data-binding","title":"D3.js 数据绑定与选择","url":"/h/data-science/data-visualization/viz-tools/d3-data-binding","wordCount":1073,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"viz-tools-ecosystem","title":"可视化工具生态","url":"/h/data-science/data-visualization/viz-tools/viz-tools-ecosystem","wordCount":1378,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"bi-tools-visualization","title":"BI 工具可视化","url":"/h/data-science/data-visualization/viz-tools/bi-tools-visualization","wordCount":2197,"readingTime":9},{"seq":4,"slug":"d3js-visualization","title":"D3.js 可视化开发","url":"/h/data-science/data-visualization/viz-tools/d3js-visualization","wordCount":2021,"readingTime":9},{"seq":5,"slug":"echarts-chart-libs","title":"ECharts 与图表库","url":"/h/data-science/data-visualization/viz-tools/echarts-chart-libs","wordCount":1899,"readingTime":8},{"seq":6,"slug":"viz-programming-paradigms","title":"可视化编程范式","url":"/h/data-science/data-visualization/viz-tools/viz-programming-paradigms","wordCount":1362,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 可视化工具 简介\n\n本章介绍数据可视化实践中的主流工具和技术栈。不同的工具适用于不同的场景和需求，从底层的绘图库到高层的BI平台，各有其定位和优势。\n\n**D3.js可视化开发**介绍D3.js这一最强大的Web可视化库，讲解其数据绑定、选择集和过渡动画等核心概念，以及如何用D3创建定制化的交互式可视化。\n\n**ECharts与图表库**对比分析ECharts、Chart.js和Highcharts等主流图表库的特点和适用场景，帮助读者在常规图表需求中快速选择合适的工具。\n\n**BI工具可视化**探讨Tableau、Power BI和Metabase等BI平台的可视化能力，分析这些工具在企业级数据分析和报表场景中的应用方法。\n\n本章关注\"用什么工具实现\"，把第 2 章选定的图表落地，并为第 4 章的仪表板组装提供技术底座。建议读者根据自身的技术角色和项目需求选择工具方向：前端开发者可侧重 D3 和 ECharts，数据分析师可重点学习 BI 工具，不必通读全部工具。\n"}